    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 is now running on Naukri for two trainee roles, Specialist Programmer (Trainee) and Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee), open to 2024, 2025 and 2026 UG/PG graduates with 0&ndash;2 years of experience. The old Infosys registration form has expired, so apply through the Naukri listings below ASAP.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Infosys Limited</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Roles</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Specialist Programmer (Trainee) &middot; Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Naukri job IDs</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">SP 151026016759 &middot; DSE 151026022319</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Eligible batch</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">2024, 2025 and 2026 UG/PG graduates</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Experience</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">0&ndash;2 years</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Qualification</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">BE/BTech (any branch); MTech, MCA, MS/MSc (any specialisation)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Bengaluru, Hyderabad, Delhi NCR (SP listing marked hybrid)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Salary</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Official (Naukri): SP L1 &#8377;10 LPA + &#8377;1 lakh joining bonus, L2 &#8377;16 LPA, L3 &#8377;21 LPA; DSE &#8377;6.25 LPA + &#8377;75,000 joining bonus | Reported: SP &#8377;8&ndash;10 LPA, DSE &#8377;5.5&ndash;7 LPA (AmbitionBox)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Openings</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">2,000 SP + 1,000 DSE</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Posted on Naukri</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">31 Oct 2026 &middot; no closing date stated, apply ASAP</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-specialist-programmer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026016759\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Specialist Programmer (Trainee) on Naukri</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Main link &middot; ID 151026016759 &middot; 2,000 openings</span></a><a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-digital-specialist-engineer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026022319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee) on Naukri</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">ID 151026022319 &middot; 1,000 openings</span></a></div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_role\" >What you will do in the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_eligibility\" >Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_selection_process\" >Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Documents_required_for_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\" >Documents required for Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\" >Preparation tips for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#How_to_apply_for_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\" >How to apply for Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#About_Infosys\" >About Infosys</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2026/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 has moved to Naukri. Infosys posted two fresh trainee listings from its official company page on 31 October 2026: one for Specialist Programmer (SP) and one for Digital Specialist Engineer (DSE). Both are aimed at engineers and postgraduates who completed their degree in 2024, 2025 or 2026 and have up to two years of work experience.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">In the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026, SP is the premium coding track with three pay levels, while DSE is the entry-level digital engineering role. Each listing carries its own Naukri ID and its own apply button, so choose the role that fits your coding strength, or apply to both if you qualify. Neither listing mentions a closing date.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FDEBEA;border-left:5px solid #C8372B;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#5B1A14;\"><strong>Expired link removed:</strong> the earlier Infosys SP/DSE registration form on surveys.infosysapps.com now shows &ldquo;The Survey is expired!&rdquo;. Do not use it. The two Naukri listings are the only live routes for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 that we could verify on 25 November 2026.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\"><strong>Your SP level is not your choice:</strong> the SP listing names three levels (L1, L2, L3) but does not explain how candidates are placed. Expect it to depend on your test and interview, so the &#8377;21 LPA figure applies only to the top band.</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Expected salary:</strong> For the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026, the Naukri listings state &#8377;10 LPA plus a &#8377;1 lakh joining bonus for SP L1, &#8377;16 LPA for SP L2 and &#8377;21 LPA for SP L3. DSE trainees get &#8377;6.25 LPA plus a &#8377;75,000 joining bonus. Reported pay on AmbitionBox is lower: Infosys Specialist Programmer freshers report about &#8377;8&ndash;10 LPA (434 salaries), and the closest DSE match (Digital Engineer) is estimated at &#8377;5.5&ndash;7 LPA. Treat the Naukri figures as the offer and the reported ranges as a reality check.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_role\"></span>What you will do in the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>SP: build full-stack applications and enterprise platforms with modern frameworks, using AI in everyday engineering work</li>\n<li>SP: write fast, clean and extensible code across object-oriented, procedural and scripting languages</li>\n<li>SP: help create new client products and contribute to open-source and internal tech groups</li>\n<li>DSE: turn functional and non-functional requirements into design, code and unit tests</li>\n<li>DSE: run functional, integration and system validation, log defects and support go-live</li>\n<li>DSE: work with stakeholders to resolve production issues</li>\n<li>Skills named on Naukri: Java, Python, Scala, full-stack development, machine learning, React.js and big data</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_eligibility\"></span>Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Batch: 2024, 2025 or 2026 UG/PG graduate</li>\n<li>Experience: 0 to 2 years, so both freshers and early-career engineers can apply</li>\n<li>UG: BTech/BE in any specialisation</li>\n<li>PG: MTech, MCA or MS/MSc in any specialisation</li>\n<li>Not stated on Naukri: percentage cut-off, backlog rule or education-gap rule</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Unconfirmed:</strong> the expired Infosys form asked for an aggregate percentage worked out as a simple average of all subjects. The Naukri listings for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 do not repeat this rule, so treat it as unconfirmed for the current round and keep your marksheets ready.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026_selection_process\"></span>Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Naukri listings for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026 do not publish a selection process. The earlier Infosys registration round described a 3-hour in-person programming test followed by an in-person interview, so plan around that pattern:</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Coding assessment (about 3 hours): past SP/DSE cycles used problems of rising difficulty, so prepare for easy, medium and hard</li>\n<li>Technical interview: expect a walk-through of your code plus DSA, OOP, DBMS and your projects</li>\n<li>HR round: not confirmed; prepare a short self-introduction anyway</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required_for_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\"></span>Documents required for Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>An updated one-page resume (build one free with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a>)</li>\n<li>10th, 12th and all semester marksheets</li>\n<li>Degree or provisional certificate</li>\n<li>Government photo ID such as Aadhaar or PAN</li>\n<li>Recent passport-size photograph</li>\n<li>Experience or relieving letters, if you have worked</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\"></span>Preparation tips for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Practise timed coding: solve one medium and one hard problem inside 90 minutes, several times a week</li>\n<li>Go deep in one language, Java or Python, including collections, recursion and complexity analysis</li>\n<li>Revise arrays, strings, hashing, trees, graphs and dynamic programming</li>\n<li>For SP, read up on Spring Boot, microservices and React basics so you can talk about them in the interview</li>\n<li>Use our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">fresher tools</a> to tidy your resume and practise</li>\n<li>Rehearse a 60-second <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self-introduction for interview</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Infosys_Off_Campus_Drive_2026\"></span>How to apply for Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Open the <a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-specialist-programmer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026016759\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Specialist Programmer (Trainee) listing on Naukri</a> (ID 151026016759) or the <a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-digital-specialist-engineer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026022319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee) listing</a> (ID 151026022319)</li>\n<li>Log in to Naukri and press Apply; make sure your batch, degree and experience are correct on your profile</li>\n<li>Apply to both listings if you qualify, since they are separate requisitions</li>\n<li>Save a screenshot of the applied status and watch your email and Naukri inbox for the test invite</li>\n<li>Never pay anyone for a slot; Infosys does not charge a fee</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\">Related: <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-off-campus-drive-2027/\">Infosys Off Campus Drive 2027 (2027 batch)</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/infosys-edgeverve-off-campus-drive-2026/\">Infosys EdgeVerve Off Campus Drive 2026</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">Companies hiring freshers</a> &middot; Official site: <a href=\"https://www.infosys.com/careers/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Infosys careers</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Infosys\"></span>About Infosys<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Infosys, the company behind the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026, is a Bengaluru-headquartered IT services and consulting firm that serves clients in dozens of countries. It hires thousands of freshers every year through campus and off-campus routes, and the SP and DSE tracks are its better-paying options for strong coders.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the salary in the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Official (Naukri): SP L1 &#8377;10 LPA plus &#8377;1 lakh joining bonus, SP L2 &#8377;16 LPA, SP L3 &#8377;21 LPA, and DSE &#8377;6.25 LPA plus &#8377;75,000 joining bonus. Reported on AmbitionBox: about &#8377;8&ndash;10 LPA for SP freshers and &#8377;5.5&ndash;7 LPA for the closest DSE match.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Which batches are eligible for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">2024, 2025 and 2026 UG/PG graduates with 0 to 2 years of experience. UG means BTech/BE in any branch; PG means MTech, MCA or MS/MSc in any specialisation.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Is the old Infosys SP/DSE registration form still open?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">No. The surveys.infosysapps.com registration form now says the survey is expired. Apply only through the two live Naukri listings, SP 151026016759 and DSE 151026022319.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Where will trainees be posted in the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Both listings name Bengaluru, Hyderabad and Delhi NCR, and the SP listing is marked hybrid. Infosys decides the final location at the offer stage.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I apply for the Infosys Off Campus Drive 2026?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Open the Naukri listing for Specialist Programmer (151026016759) or Digital Specialist Engineer (151026022319), log in and press Apply. No closing date is stated, so apply ASAP.</p>\n</details>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-specialist-programmer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026016759\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Specialist Programmer (Trainee) on Naukri</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Main link &middot; ID 151026016759 &middot; 2,000 openings</span></a><a href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-digital-specialist-engineer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026022319\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee) on Naukri</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">ID 151026022319 &middot; 1,000 openings</span></a></div>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-specialist-programmer-trainee-infosys-hyderabad-bengaluru-delhi-ncr-0-to-2-years-151026016759\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Specialist Programmer (Trainee)\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Infosys\",\"value\":\"151026016759\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-10-31\",\"description\":\"Infosys Specialist Programmer (Trainee) for 2024, 2025 and 2026 UG/PG graduates with 0 to 2 years of experience. Build full-stack applications and enterprise platforms in Java, Python, Scala and modern frameworks. Three levels: L1 INR 10 LPA plus INR 1 lakh joining bonus, L2 INR 16 LPA, L3 INR 21 LPA. Hybrid, Bengaluru, Hyderabad or Delhi NCR. Apply on Naukri.\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Infosys Limited\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.infosys.com\"},\"jobLocation\":[{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Bengaluru\",\"addressRegion\":\"Karnataka\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Hyderabad\",\"addressRegion\":\"Telangana\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"New Delhi\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}}],\"educationRequirements\":{\"@type\":\"EducationalOccupationalCredential\",\"credentialCategory\":\"bachelor degree\"},\"experienceRequirements\":{\"@type\":\"OccupationalExperienceRequirements\",\"monthsOfExperience\":0},\"baseSalary\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"INR\",\"value\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"minValue\":1000000,\"maxValue\":2100000,\"unitText\":\"YEAR\"}},\"directApply\":false}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee)\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Infosys\",\"value\":\"151026022319\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-10-31\",\"description\":\"Infosys Digital Specialist Engineer (Trainee) for 2024, 2025 and 2026 UG/PG graduates with 0 to 2 years of experience. Design, develop, test and support digital solutions and handle production issues. INR 6.25 LPA plus INR 75,000 joining bonus. Bengaluru, Hyderabad or Delhi NCR. Apply on Naukri.\",\"employmentType\":\"FULL_TIME\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Infosys Limited\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.infosys.com\"},\"jobLocation\":[{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Bengaluru\",\"addressRegion\":\"Karnataka\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN